{{Quote|Kamino. It's not a system I'm familiar with. Are you sure you have the right coordinates?''"<br />"''According to my information, it should appear in this quadrant here, just south of the Rishi Maze.|[[Jocasta Nu]] and [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]]|<ref name="Episode II" />}}
The '''Kamino system''' was a [[Wild Space]] [[star system]] situated beyond the [[Outer Rim Territories]] and just south of the companion [[galaxy]] known as the [[Rishi Maze]], as a result was sometime considered [[extragalactic]]. The system contained thirteen [[planet]]s, including the [[ocean]] world of [[Kamino]], [[Homeworld|home]] to the [[Kaminoan]] [[scientist]]s who [[Cloning|created]] the [[clone trooper]]s of the [[Grand Army of the Republic]]. [[Kamino's star]] was described as "aging."

==Description==
The Kamino system was a [[Wild Space]]<ref name="EURWS" /> [[star system]]<ref name="SWCL" /> located beyond the [[Outer Rim Territories]] and south<ref name="Kamino Databank">{{Databank|kamino|Kamino}}</ref> of the dwarf [[Rishi Maze]] [[galaxy]]. It could be considered to be [[extragalactic]] due to its location.<ref name="SWCL" /> The system contained the [[ocean]] [[Planet|world]] of [[Kamino]],<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" /> [[homeworld]] of the [[Kaminoan]] [[species]] who created the [[clone trooper]]s of the [[Grand Army of the Republic]],<ref name="Episode II" /> as well as twelve other planets, and Kamino's aging [[Kamino's star|star]].<ref name="SWCL" />

